(21727,217,'Is there a visitor information point where I can ask for assistance?','Có điểm thông tin du khách để tôi xin hỗ trợ không?','/ɪz ðɛr ə ˈvɪzɪtər ˌɪnˌfɔrˈmeɪʃən pɔɪnt wɛr aɪ kən æsk fər əˈsɪstəns/','','PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
