(40623,406,'Can I ask for the preparation instructions in writing?','Tôi xin hướng dẫn chuẩn bị bằng văn bản nhé?','/kən aɪ æsk fər ðə ˌprɛpərˈeɪʃən ˌɪnˈstrəkʃənz ɪn ˈraɪtɪŋ/','','PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
