(40821,408,'Which lift should I use to reach the department?','Tôi dùng thang máy nào để đến khoa?','/wɪʧ lɪft ʃʊd aɪ juz tɪ riʧ ðə dɪˈpɑrtmənt/','','PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
(40822,408,'Check the department sign beside the lifts.','Hãy xem biển chỉ khoa cạnh thang máy.','/ʧɛk ðə dɪˈpɑrtmənt saɪn ˌbiˈsaɪd ðə lɪfts/','','PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
