(42930,429,'A single feedback record will make the changes easier to track.','Một hồ sơ góp ý chung sẽ giúp dễ theo dõi thay đổi.','/ə ˈsɪŋgəl ˈfidˌbæk ˈrɛkərd wɪl meɪk ðə ˈʧeɪnʤɪz ˈiziər tɪ træk/','','PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
